1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,900
PINKY: Hey, adventurers! We have something REALLY exciting to tell you!

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,600
MAVILI: We're getting closer!

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,500
KÜP KUZU: Like… REALLY close!

4
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,200
PINKY: Ha ha!

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:13,500
PINKY: Rush for Villains is currently in Closed Beta on Android!

6
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,400
MAVILI: And right now, we need more adventurers to join us!

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,500
KÜP KUZU: Yep! That means YOU!

8
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:27,600
PINKY: With enough support and testers, we can complete this stage and get closer to bringing Rush for Villains to everyone!

9
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:28,900
MAVILI: Android…

10
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,250
KÜP KUZU: …AND iOS!

11
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,600
PINKY: Want to help us?

12
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,600
MAVILI: Check the links in our Instagram bio…

13
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:38,800
KÜP KUZU: …and join our Android Closed Beta!

14
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:44,700
PINKY: Every person who joins means so much to us.

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,400
MAVILI: You're not just testing a game…

16
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,800
KÜP KUZU: You're helping us build it!

17
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:55,000
PINKY: So help us bring Rush for Villains to both Android and iOS!

18
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,800
PINKY: Join the Closed Beta!

19
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,300
MAVILI: Help us grow!

20
00:01:02,550 --> 00:01:04,400
KÜP KUZU: And join the adventure!

21
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,100
ALL: SEE YOU IN RUSH FOR VILLAINS!
